-- Optional one-time seed for the restaurants/dishes tables.
-- Mirrors public/data/restaurants.json (same ids) so the two stay in sync.
-- Not required for the app to function -- the frontend reads restaurants
-- from the bundled JSON directly, never from these tables.
-- Safe to re-run: truncates both tables first so re-seeding never leaves
-- stale rows from a previous generation of restaurants.json around.

truncate table dishes, restaurants restart identity cascade;









































